<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Website on Ayham's Online Website</title><link>https://ayham.xyz/tags/website/</link><description>Recent content in Website on Ayham's Online Website</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>me@ayham.xyz (ayham)</managingEditor><webMaster>me@ayham.xyz (ayham)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 23 Aug 2023 04:07:04 +0300</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ayham.xyz/tags/website/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Pushing Static Pages to The Limit</title><link>https://ayham.xyz/posts/pushing-static-pages-to-the-limit/</link><pubDate>Sun, 04 Sep 2022 18:07:13 +0300</pubDate><author>me@ayham.xyz (ayham)</author><guid>https://ayham.xyz/posts/pushing-static-pages-to-the-limit/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Static webpages are well renowned for their speed, security, and simplicity. A
very common misconception is that static webpages can&amp;rsquo;t enjoy Javascript. Here
is how I got this website to template applications that use Javascript and WASM
using Hugo&amp;rsquo;s shortcode system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="addapp-js--css-shortcode"&gt;addapp (JS + CSS) shortcode&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a new shortcode file in &lt;code&gt;theme/&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;/layouts/shortcodes/addapp.html&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div style="color:#d0d0d0;background-color:#202020;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#d0d0d0;background-color:#202020;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#686868"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#686868"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#686868"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#686868"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#686868"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#686868"&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#d0d0d0;background-color:#202020;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-html" data-lang="html"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#999;font-style:italic"&gt;&amp;lt;!-- ENTERING SHORTCODE: addapp --&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{- $appName := .Get 0 }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{- $appJS := resources.Get (printf &amp;#34;apps/%s/app.js&amp;#34; ($appName | safeURL)) }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{- partial (printf &amp;#34;apps/%s/app.html&amp;#34; ($appName | safeURL)) . }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;span style="color:#6ab825;font-weight:bold"&gt;script&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#bbb"&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;=&lt;span style="color:#ed9d13"&gt;&amp;#34;{{ $appJS.Permalink }}&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;span style="color:#6ab825;font-weight:bold"&gt;script&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#999;font-style:italic"&gt;&amp;lt;!-- EXITING SHORTCODE: addapp --&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then call the shortcode, for example, in this website&amp;rsquo;s game sokoban (file:
&lt;code&gt;content/apps/sokoban.md&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>blogit: A Complete Guide</title><link>https://ayham.xyz/posts/blogit-to-blog-it/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Nov 2021 19:18:52 +0300</pubDate><author>me@ayham.xyz (ayham)</author><guid>https://ayham.xyz/posts/blogit-to-blog-it/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Running a personal website should be an easy task. Unfortunately, a big
hindrance is that there aren&amp;rsquo;t many &amp;ldquo;suckless&amp;rdquo; blogging system.



&lt;dev&gt;
&lt;a href="https://pedantic.software/git/blogit"target="_blank"&gt;blogit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class="externalLink"&gt;🔗&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/dev&gt; is the closest in terms of
simplicity and minimalism to perfection. This article would be an end-all be-all
guide to effectively install blogit onto your own website.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>